.DS_Store
claude.md
claude2.md

# Terraform
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
# Saved plans are usually written as `-out=tfplan` with no extension, which
# *.tfplan does not match. Plan files embed resolved variable values and
# should never be committed.
tfplan
tfplan.*
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
# .terraform.lock.hcl is intentionally NOT ignored — commit it to pin provider versions

# Real deployment values — account-specific (bucket names, domain). Copy
# terraform.tfvars.example to terraform.tfvars and fill in your own; never
# commit the real one.
terraform.tfvars
!terraform.tfvars.example

# Partial backend config — holds your real state bucket name. See
# terraform/live/backend.tf's comment for how to generate this.
backend.hcl

# Helm — packaged subchart artifacts, regenerated via `helm dependency update`
charts/*.tgz

# Full `helm show values` dumps — reference lookups, not real config; regenerate on demand
*.reference.yaml
